"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nA place I found because I wanted to eat a somewhat special udon.  \nThe texture of the udon noodles is alive.  \nIt's a place worth visiting if you want the texture of chewy udon noodles.  \n\nThe tempura received as a service was also not greasy and delicious.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n"